                                "sense_id": "0cedfd78-5c9e-3ae8-b1fc-7b93d3a1f784",
                                "text": "The general complaints of disease among us, were a dizziness in the head, great weakness of the joints, and violent tenesmus, most of us having had no evacuation by stool since we left the ship."
                            }
                        ]
